        <p source="#source-19782-19888"><seg source="#source-19782-19800">ある日、わが</seg><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-89-54" source="#source-19800-19847">窻</g><seg source="#source-19847-19850">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19850-19871"><rb>硝子</rb><rt>がらす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19871-19888">のしたに、</seg></p>
