        <p source="#source-24989-25162"><seg source="#source-24989-25004">さて組合の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25004-25031"><rb>禿頭</rb><rt>はげあたま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25031-25070">のトムソンが赤つちやけたる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25070-25094"><rb>鹿爪</rb><rt>しかつめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25094-25103">らしき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25103-25139"><rb>古外套</rb><rt>ふるぐわいたう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25139-25162">ををかしがり、</seg></p>
