        <p source="#source-25432-25595"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25432-25447"><rb>終</rb><rt>つひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25447-25459">に斃れし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25459-25492"><rb>旅芸人</rb><rt>たびげいにん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25492-25510">のかつぽれが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25510-25537"><rb>臨終</rb><rt>りんじゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25537-25540">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25540-25573"><rb>道化姿</rb><rt>どうけすがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25573-25595">ぞ目に浮ぶ。</seg></p>
