        <p source="#source-51914-51997"><seg source="#source-51914-51929">そのなかの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51929-51944"><rb>小</rb><rt>ちひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51944-51950">さな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51950-51992"><rb>人口花壇</rb><rt>じんこうくわだん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51992-51997">、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-51997-52077"><seg source="#source-51997-52000">（</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52000-52015"><rb>疲</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52015-52021">れた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52021-52039"><rb>瞳</rb><rt>ひとみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52039-52042">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52042-52072"><rb>避難所</rb><rt>ひなんしよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52072-52077">）</seg></p>
