        <p source="#source-52335-52424"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52335-52347"><rb>絶</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52347-52353">えず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52353-52365"><rb>絶</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52365-52371">えず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52371-52395"><rb>電車</rb><rt>でんしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52395-52398">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52398-52413"><rb>通</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52413-52424">る……</seg></p>
